The Russians seem to be hoarding bio-metal scrap, Major. You are to investigate a nearby storage facility to ascertain how much they are storing.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Inspect the Russian scrap storage facility.
- Remember to cloak!

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
We believe the facility to have light defensive capabilities, but nothing worrying. The only obstacle is a minefield which lies between us and the facility, but this should pose no great problem.